---
title: Vegan Spice Bag with Curry Sauce
image: https://cheapandcheerfulcooking.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/vegan-spice-bag-with-curry-sauce-1.jpg
source: https://cheapandcheerfulcooking.com/vegan-spice-bag-with-curry-sauce
servings: '2'
---

Halve @onion{1/2}(peeled) and cut into thin strips. Cut @pepper{1/2}(green) into thin strips as well. Cut @carrot{1/2} into even thinner strips. Finely dice @garlic{1%clove}(clove). Cut @chili pepper{1/2} into fine rings.

Prepare @fries{500%g} and @vegan chicken nuggets{180%g} according to your own preferences.

Heat a dash of @vegetable oil{} in a large #frying pan{} over a high heat. Stir-fry the vegetables (@carrot{}, @pepper{}, @onion{}) for ~{30%seconds}. Once they have taken on some colour, add the @garlic{} and @chili pepper{} and remove from the heat.

Cut the nuggets into bite-sized strips or pieces. Mix with the @fries{500%g}, vegetables, and spices (@five spice powder{2%tsp}, @salt{1%tsp}, @chili flakes{1%tsp}). Serve together with the curry sauce (or sauce of choice).


== Optional: Quick Curry Sauce ==

Finely dice @onion{1/2}(peeled) and @garlic{1%clove}(clove).

Sauté the @onion{}(diced) in some @vegetable oil{} over a medium heat for at least ~{5%minutes}. Add the @garlic{}(clove) and @wheat flour{1%tbsp} and fry, stirring, for another minute.

Gradually deglaze with @vegetable stock{300%ml} while stirring, add the remaining ingredients (@applesauce{2%tbsp}, @curry powder{1%tbsp}, @five spice powder{1%tsp}, @salt{1/2%tsp}) and simmer gently for about ~{10%minutes}. Puree until smooth before serving.

== Optional: Vegan Gravy Sauce ==

Prepare @./Vegan Gravy{}